{
  "purpose": "Bench continuation packet 7 replay: node 2 TPDO1 1800:05 raw 0 to 100 through the production EVENT_TIMER lifecycle (E), from a freshly checked baseline, with readback; then packet 6's NMT boundary rerun with the admission time (stream at raw 100 in Operational, then Enter Pre-operational); then the separate restoration E2,0 and a short regression on node 1. Final intended state: both nodes Pre-operational, 1800:05 raw 0 on both.",
